@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign left
title Thiết kế – Biểu đồ tuần tự thiết kế – Approve and Export Order 0 (86 bước, kịch bản v3)

actor "NV bán hàng" as A
boundary "gdSaleHome.jsp" as gdSaleHome
boundary "gdOrderList.jsp" as gdOrderList
boundary "gdOrderDetail.jsp" as gdOrderDetail
boundary "doApproveOrder.jsp" as doApproveOrder
boundary "gdDeliveryStaffList.jsp" as gdDeliveryStaffList
boundary "doSaveAssign.jsp" as doSaveAssign
boundary "doExportOrder.jsp" as doExportOrder
boundary "gdInvoicePrint.jsp" as gdInvoicePrint
control "OrderDAO" as OrderDAO
control "OrderDetailDAO" as OrderDetailDAO
control "DeliveryStaffDAO" as DeliveryStaffDAO
control "ProductDAO" as ProductDAO
control "InvoiceDAO" as InvoiceDAO
entity "Order" as Order
entity "OrderDetail" as OrderDetail
entity "DeliveryStaff" as DeliveryStaff
entity "Invoice" as Invoice

A -> gdSaleHome : 1: click Duyệt và xuất đơn
gdSaleHome -> gdOrderList : 2: gọi
gdOrderList --> A : 3: hiển thị
A -> gdOrderList : 4: chọn Chưa xuất + click Lọc
gdOrderList -> gdOrderList : 5: submit
gdOrderList -> OrderDAO : 6: gọi
OrderDAO -> OrderDAO : 7: getUnexportedOrder()
OrderDAO -> Order : 8: gọi
Order -> Order : 9: Order()
Order --> OrderDAO : 10: trả về
OrderDAO --> gdOrderList : 11: trả về
gdOrderList --> A : 12: hiển thị
A -> gdOrderList : 13: click DH1024
gdOrderList -> gdOrderDetail : 14: gọi
gdOrderDetail -> OrderDetailDAO : 15: gọi
OrderDetailDAO -> OrderDetailDAO : 16: getOrderDetailByOrder(idOrder)
OrderDetailDAO -> OrderDetail : 17: gọi
OrderDetail -> OrderDetail : 18: OrderDetail()
OrderDetail --> OrderDetailDAO : 19: trả về
OrderDetailDAO --> gdOrderDetail : 20: trả về
gdOrderDetail --> A : 21: hiển thị
A -> gdOrderDetail : 22: click Duyệt đơn
gdOrderDetail -> doApproveOrder : 23: gọi
doApproveOrder -> Order : 24: gọi
Order -> Order : 25: setStatus(), setSaleStaff(), setApprovedAt()
Order --> doApproveOrder : 26: trả về
doApproveOrder -> OrderDAO : 27: gọi
OrderDAO -> OrderDAO : 28: approveOrder(order)
OrderDAO --> doApproveOrder : 29: trả về
doApproveOrder --> A : 30: thông báo thành công
A -> doApproveOrder : 31: click OK
doApproveOrder -> gdOrderDetail : 32: gọi
gdOrderDetail --> A : 33: hiển thị
A -> gdOrderDetail : 34: click Chọn NV giao hàng
gdOrderDetail -> gdDeliveryStaffList : 35: gọi
gdDeliveryStaffList -> DeliveryStaffDAO : 36: gọi
DeliveryStaffDAO -> DeliveryStaffDAO : 37: getAvailableDeliveryStaff()
DeliveryStaffDAO -> DeliveryStaff : 38: gọi
DeliveryStaff -> DeliveryStaff : 39: DeliveryStaff()
DeliveryStaff --> DeliveryStaffDAO : 40: trả về
DeliveryStaffDAO --> gdDeliveryStaffList : 41: trả về
gdDeliveryStaffList --> A : 42: hiển thị
A -> gdDeliveryStaffList : 43: chọn GH03 + click Lưu phân công
gdDeliveryStaffList -> doSaveAssign : 44: gọi
doSaveAssign -> Order : 45: gọi
Order -> Order : 46: setDeliveryStaff()
Order --> doSaveAssign : 47: trả về
doSaveAssign -> OrderDAO : 48: gọi
OrderDAO -> OrderDAO : 49: assignDeliveryStaff(order)
OrderDAO --> doSaveAssign : 50: trả về
doSaveAssign --> A : 51: thông báo thành công
A -> doSaveAssign : 52: click OK
doSaveAssign -> gdOrderDetail : 53: gọi
gdOrderDetail --> A : 54: hiển thị
A -> gdOrderDetail : 55: click Xác nhận xuất hàng
gdOrderDetail -> doExportOrder : 56: gọi
doExportOrder -> Order : 57: gọi
Order -> Order : 58: setStatus(), setSaleStaff(), setExportedAt()
Order --> doExportOrder : 59: trả về
doExportOrder -> OrderDAO : 60: gọi
OrderDAO -> OrderDAO : 61: exportOrder(order)
OrderDAO -> ProductDAO : 62: gọi
ProductDAO -> ProductDAO : 63: checkStock(listDetail)
ProductDAO --> OrderDAO : 64: trả về
OrderDAO -> ProductDAO : 65: gọi
ProductDAO -> ProductDAO : 66: decreaseStock(listDetail)
ProductDAO --> OrderDAO : 67: trả về
OrderDAO -> InvoiceDAO : 68: gọi
InvoiceDAO -> InvoiceDAO : 69: issueInvoice(order)
InvoiceDAO --> OrderDAO : 70: trả về
OrderDAO --> doExportOrder : 71: trả về
doExportOrder --> A : 72: thông báo thành công
A -> doExportOrder : 73: click OK
doExportOrder -> gdOrderDetail : 74: gọi
gdOrderDetail --> A : 75: hiển thị
A -> gdOrderDetail : 76: click In hóa đơn
gdOrderDetail -> gdInvoicePrint : 77: gọi
gdInvoicePrint -> InvoiceDAO : 78: gọi
InvoiceDAO -> InvoiceDAO : 79: getInvoiceDetail(idInvoice, idCustomer)
InvoiceDAO -> Invoice : 80: gọi
Invoice -> Invoice : 81: Invoice()
Invoice --> InvoiceDAO : 82: trả về
InvoiceDAO --> gdInvoicePrint : 83: trả về
gdInvoicePrint --> A : 84: hiển thị
A -> gdInvoicePrint : 85: click In
gdInvoicePrint --> A : 86: in hóa đơn
@enduml
